IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cpp-core`
IMPORT `cpp-core-calendar`
IMPORT `cpp-core-age`
IMPORT `cp5-months`
IMPORT `cp5-d-disability`

-- Tests of sections 69 to 70.02 (cp5-d-disability.l4). Expected values were worked out by hand from the text.
-- A person born on 15 June 1960 turns 65 on 15 June 2025. Section 70 uses the actual birthday (June 2025);
-- section 70.02 uses section 2(2), under which 65 is reached in July 2025.

§ `Tests of sections 69 to 70.02`

§§ `Section 69`

-- Became disabled in March 2020: the fourth month following is July 2020.
#ASSERT `s 69 — the month a disability pension is first payable` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12) FALSE EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2020 7 1)
-- Across a year end: disabled in October 2020, the fourth month following is February 2021.
#ASSERT `s 69 — the month a disability pension is first payable` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2020 10 31) FALSE EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2021 2 1)
-- In receipt of a disability pension in the five years before: the month next following, April 2020.
#ASSERT `s 69 — the month a disability pension is first payable` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12) TRUE EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2020 4 1)
-- Payment not approved: the section decides nothing.
#ASSERT `s 69 — the month a disability pension is first payable` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Paragraph (b): twelve months replaces fifteen only for a person who recently received a disability pension.
#ASSERT `s 69(b) — the number of months to read in place of fifteen months in paragraph 42(2)(b)` TRUE EQUALS JUST 12
#ASSERT `s 69(b) — the number of months to read in place of fifteen months in paragraph 42(2)(b)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The five-year period next before March 2020 begins in March 2015 and ends with February 2020.
#ASSERT `s 69 — the first month of the five-year period next before the month the applicant became disabled` (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2015 3 1
#ASSERT `s 69 — a month falls within the five-year period next before the month the applicant became disabled` (YearMonthDay 2015 3 20) (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 69 — a month falls within the five-year period next before the month the applicant became disabled` (YearMonthDay 2015 2 28) (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12))
#ASSERT `s 69 — a month falls within the five-year period next before the month the applicant became disabled` (YearMonthDay 2020 2 1) (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 69 — a month falls within the five-year period next before the month the applicant became disabled` (YearMonthDay 2020 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 69 — a month falls within the five-year period next before the month the applicant became disabled` (YearMonthDay 2020 4 1) (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12))

§§ `Subsection 70(1)`

-- Nothing else happens: the pension ceases with the payment for the month of the 65th birthday, June 2025.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 6 1
-- (a) ceased to be disabled in September 2022.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2022 9 10)) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2022 9 1
-- (b) a retirement pension first payable for January 2023: the month immediately preceding, December 2022 (across a year end).
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2023 1 1)) (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2022 12 1
-- (d) died in February 2024.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2024 2 1)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2024 2 1
-- Several events: the earliest governs (September 2022).
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2022 9 10)) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2023 1 1)) (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2024 2 1)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2022 9 1
-- An event after the 65th birthday does not extend the pension: ceased to be disabled in September 2026, 65 reached in June 2025.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 9 10)) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 6 1
-- A retirement pension first payable for July 2025 is preceded by June 2025: the same month as the 65th birthday's.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1)) (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 6 1
-- The 65th birthday on 31 January 2025 (born 31 January 1960): the month of the birthday, January 2025, not February.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — the last month for which a disability pension is payable` NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 1 31) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 1 1
-- Payable for a month: from the first month through the last.
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — a disability pension is payable for a month` (YearMonthDay 2025 6 30) (YearMonthDay 2020 8 1) NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 70(1) — a disability pension is payable for a month` (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1) (YearMonthDay 2020 8 1) NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING)
#ASSERT `s 70(1) — a disability pension is payable for a month` (YearMonthDay 2020 8 15) (YearMonthDay 2020 8 1) NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 70(1) — a disability pension is payable for a month` (YearMonthDay 2020 7 31) (YearMonthDay 2020 8 1) NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING)

§§ `Subsection 70(2)`

-- Ceases because the beneficiary reached 65: nothing earlier.
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the disability pension ceases to be payable by reason of the beneficiary having reached 65` NOTHING NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING
-- Ceased to be disabled earlier: not by reason of reaching 65.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 70(2) — the disability pension ceases to be payable by reason of the beneficiary having reached 65` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2022 9 10)) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING)
-- The application is deemed made in the month the beneficiary reached 65 (June 2025) for a pension to commence in July 2025.
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the month in which an application for a retirement pension is deemed made by and received from the person` TRUE (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2025 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the month with which the retirement pension applied for is to commence` TRUE (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1)
-- Born 31 January 1960: reached 65 in January 2025 (the actual birthday), so the pension commences in February 2025.
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the month in which an application for a retirement pension is deemed made by and received from the person` TRUE (YearMonthDay 1960 1 31) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2025 1 1)
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the month with which the retirement pension applied for is to commence` TRUE (YearMonthDay 1960 1 31) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2025 2 1)
-- Born 15 December 1960: December 2025, commencing January 2026 (across a year end).
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the month with which the retirement pension applied for is to commence` TRUE (YearMonthDay 1960 12 15) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1)
-- Not ceased by reason of 65: no deemed application.
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the month in which an application for a retirement pension is deemed made by and received from the person` FALSE (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 70(2) — the month with which the retirement pension applied for is to commence` FALSE (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Subsection 70(3)`

-- A retirement pension has begun: ineligible to apply or re-apply for a disability pension.
#ASSERT `s 70(3) — the person is ineligible to apply or re-apply for a disability pension` TRUE FALSE
-- Except as provided in section 66.1 or a substantially similar provincial provision.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 70(3) — the person is ineligible to apply or re-apply for a disability pension` TRUE TRUE)
-- No retirement pension: the subsection does not bar.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 70(3) — the person is ineligible to apply or re-apply for a disability pension` FALSE FALSE)

§§ `Section 70.01`

-- Became disabled in March 2020 (after December 2018): July 2020 (fourth month following).
#ASSERT `s 70.01 — the month a post-retirement disability benefit is first payable` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12) FALSE EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2020 7 1)
-- In receipt of a disability pension or post-retirement disability benefit in the previous five years: April 2020.
#ASSERT `s 70.01 — the month a post-retirement disability benefit is first payable` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12) TRUE EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2020 4 1)
-- Became disabled in the first month after December 2018, January 2019: the fourth month following is May 2019.
#ASSERT `s 70.01 — the month a post-retirement disability benefit is first payable` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2019 1 1) FALSE EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2019 5 1)
-- Became disabled in December 2018: not a month after December 2018; the section decides nothing.
#ASSERT `s 70.01 — the month a post-retirement disability benefit is first payable` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2018 12 20) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not approved.
#ASSERT `s 70.01 — the month a post-retirement disability benefit is first payable` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2020 3 12) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 70.01(b) — the number of months to read in place of fifteen months in paragraph 42(2)(b)` TRUE EQUALS JUST 12
#ASSERT `s 70.01(b) — the number of months to read in place of fifteen months in paragraph 42(2)(b)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Section 70.02`

-- Born 15 June 1960: 65 is reached in July 2025 for this section (section 2(2)); nothing earlier.
#ASSERT `s 70.02 — the last month for which a post-retirement disability benefit is payable` NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 7 1
-- Ceased to be disabled in September 2024.
#ASSERT `s 70.02 — the last month for which a post-retirement disability benefit is payable` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2024 9 3)) (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2024 9 1
-- Died in February 2025.
#ASSERT `s 70.02 — the last month for which a post-retirement disability benefit is payable` NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2025 2 14)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 2 1
-- Both: the earlier, September 2024.
#ASSERT `s 70.02 — the last month for which a post-retirement disability benefit is payable` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2024 9 3)) (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2025 2 14)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2024 9 1
-- Born 31 January 1960: section 2(2) puts 65 in February 2025, unlike section 70(1)(c).
#ASSERT `s 70.02 — the last month for which a post-retirement disability benefit is payable` NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 1 31) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 2 1
-- Payable for a month.
#ASSERT `s 70.02 — a post-retirement disability benefit is payable for a month` (YearMonthDay 2025 7 31) (YearMonthDay 2020 8 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 70.02 — a post-retirement disability benefit is payable for a month` (YearMonthDay 2025 8 1) (YearMonthDay 2020 8 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 70.02 — a post-retirement disability benefit is payable for a month` (YearMonthDay 2020 7 31) (YearMonthDay 2020 8 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 1960 6 15) NOTHING)
